            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## HR Zone Settings \u2014 Recalculated from Raw Data (Best Practice, May 2026)\n\n| Anchor | Value | Derivation |\n|---|---|---|\n| **HRmax** | **184 bpm** | Validated: 5 Feb 2025 trail run, ~26 min sustained near max (all-time per-sec p99.99 = 184; 205/217 are spikes) |\n| **Resting HR** | **47 bpm** | Sleeping-HR floor (30d abs min 46, 1st pct 48) |\n| **HRR** | **137 bpm** | 184 \u2212 47 |\n| **LTHR / FTHR** | **166 bpm** | Best sustained 20-min HR (5 Sep 2025 run, last-20-min avg 165.9) = 90.2% HRmax |\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Old `AthleteProfile.lthr_bpm = 136` was **invalid** \u2014 it equalled HRR (184\u221247), a Garmin misconfig artefact, not a threshold. Corrected to **166**.\n\n---\n\n### Method 1 \u2014 Karvonen (HRR-based)\n| Zone | Name | % HRR | BPM |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Z1** | Recovery | 50-60% | **116 - 129** |\n| **Z2** | Aerobic Base | 60-70% | **129 - 143** |\n| **Z3** | Aerobic Threshold | 70-80% | **143 - 157** |\n| **Z4** | Lactate Threshold | 80-90% | **157 - 170** |\n| **Z5** | VO2max | 90-100% | **170 - 184** |\n\n### Method 2 \u2014 Friel (LTHR-based)\n| Zone | Name | % LTHR | BPM |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Z1** | Recovery | <85% | **< 141** |\n| **Z2** | Aerobic | 85-89% | **141 - 148** |\n| **Z3** | Tempo | 90-94% | **149 - 156** |\n| **Z4** | Sub-Threshold | 95-99% | **158 - 164** |\n| **Z5a** | Super-Threshold | 100-102% | **166 - 169** |\n| **Z5b** | Aerobic Capacity | 103-106% | **171 - 176** |\n| **Z5c** | Anaerobic | >106% | **177+** |\n\n### Method 3 \u2014 FTHR (field-test threshold)\nIdentical to Friel/LTHR for running (same threshold anchor, 166 bpm). Enter a separate value here only if you run a distinct bike 20-min field test.\n\n---\n\n**Medication note:** Zones reflect current pharmacological state (Atenolol 25mg + Vyvanse 60mg).\n**Ultra target:** 80-85% of weekly volume in Z1-Z2 (Karvonen 116-143 bpm).",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "13.0.1",
        "targets": [],
        "title": "YOUR HR ZONES \u2014 Three Methodologies (Program Karvonen Into Garmin)",
        "type": "text"
      },
