          },
          "content": "## HRmax Evidence Summary\n\n**328+ activities | Jan 2024 to May 2026**\n\n| Metric | Value | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Highest observed | 217 | Artefact |\n| 2nd highest | 205 | Spike |\n| Best credible (running) | **184** | 26 min near-max |\n| All-time per-sec p99.99 | **184** | confirmed |\n| Running 95th percentile | 177 | confirmed |\n| **HRmax (USE THIS)** | **184** | validated |\n\n**Definitive evidence:**\n5 Feb 2025 Trail Run \u2014 MaxHR 184, AvgHR 151, session p99.9 = 182 (sustained, not a spike).\n\n---\n\n## LTHR Evidence Summary\n\n| Effort | Best 20-min HR |\n|---|---|\n| 5 Sep 2025 trail run | **165.9** |\n| 23 Sep 2025 trail run | ~161 |\n| **LTHR (USE THIS)** | **166** |\n\nFriel protocol: avg HR of a sustained ~20-min maximal effort. 166 = 90.2% of HRmax \u2014 textbook for a trained athlete.\n\n---\n\n## RHR Evidence Summary\n\n| Metric (30d sleeping HR) | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Absolute min | 46 |\n| 1st percentile | 48 |\n| **Floor (USE THIS)** | **47** |",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
